# Flight data providers — optional. You can also paste keys at /settings in
# the running app, which writes to .skyhop-config.json (gitignored).
#
# If both .env values AND /settings values are present, /settings wins.
# When no credentials are set anywhere, the app uses bundled mock data.

# ─── Amadeus Self-Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://developers.amadeus.com/register
# Create a Self-Service app to get an API Key (client id) + API Secret.
AMADEUS_CLIENT_ID=
AMADEUS_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Default is the test environment. Set to `api.amadeus.com` once you've
# moved your Amadeus app to production.
# AMADEUS_HOSTNAME=test.api.amadeus.com

# ─── Kiwi Tequila ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://tequila.kiwi.com/portal/login/registration
# Create a Solution; the API key appears on the Solutions page.
KIWI_API_KEY=
